deo/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-</strong><u> <strong>UPGRADE YOUR ARSENAL</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft or Upgrade items,</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exchange your resources in the shop.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Buy new tools, weapons, perks that will make you stronger and more versatile.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431980/extras/415bfb05a6fca35131100721888d6992.poster.avif?t=1755621886\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431980/extras/415bfb05a6fca35131100721888d6992.webm?t=1755621886\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3431980/extras/415bfb05a6fca35131100721888d6992.mp4?t=1755621886\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u><strong>- SAVE THE GALAXY</strong></u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An interdimensional breach has opened in your galaxy. You're mission is to reach and seal it.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-<u>\u00a0PLAY WITH YOU FRIENDS</u></strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be played with up to 4 players online.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
